# Open name lists and company registers behind the name and company training data (tools/data/provenance/names-us-ca.md has the
# licence of each, quoted from its publisher). Format: file <local name> <size in bytes> <sha256> <url>.
# Several of these are replaced in place by their publisher (the SEC list, the Companies House snapshot is dated, GLEIF is a daily
# copy), so the pin is the hash; a newer release fails the check until the pin and the provenance entry are updated on purpose.
register names
